  "description": "On his very first night after moving in, Jung Sun-ho accidentally witnesses the man next door in the middle of an obscene act. Shocked by his first-ever live strip show, Sun-ho tries his best to ignore it. But as days pass and the neighbor keeps cycling through different men every night, Sun-ho’s mind is on the verge of breaking. Then one night, he sees the man being strangled—and calls the police… only to find out it was just part of the play?! Having unwittingly earned credit for busting down his door, the neighbor—Shin Won-je—threatens Sun-ho: if he doesn’t want to be sued, he’ll have to do exactly as Won-je says…\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/M_inWINDOW/)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/m_inwindow)",
